# Detect-only is the default for threat-list domains (domainIocBlockMode = false), so
# the tunnel logs reason "IOC_detect: ..." and the APP RISKS Blocked line says so.
# Precondition (Q6-3): the MVT rows must be loaded before the ping, or the tunnel
# never matches and there is no Blocked line at all.
Blocked : 2y4nothing.xyz no (blocking is off for threat-list domains)
!Blocked : 2y4nothing.xyz yes
